# include-into-split root
library "Root".
include "Shared".

// Root does NOT reference Shared in any concept definition or representation.
// The ONLY link is the source `include "Shared"` line above. Pre-fix the guard
// (which walked concept-definition refs only) stayed silent, and Root.cql
// emitted a DANGLING `include Shared` that no "Shared.cql" satisfies (Shared
// auto-splits). The guard must now fail-closed over the source-include set too.
concept "Root Local":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `root-local`.
